# Original unoptimised source assets.
# Leading slash anchors this to the repo ROOT. Without it, Git on a
# case-insensitive filesystem also matches assets/images/ and silently
# excludes every optimised image the site actually loads.
# Remove this line if you want the originals tracked in the repo.
/Images/

# Full-page reference screenshots (~40MB of source material, not deliverables).
# Delete these lines if you want them tracked in the repo.
unrealproductions website reference.png
unrealproductions website reference copy.png
unrealproductions.co.png

# Loose working files kept at the project root. The fonts are duplicated
# into assets/fonts/ and the screenshots are design references, not site
# assets — none of them belong in the deployed site.
/BenguiatITCbyBT-BoldCondensed.woff2
/cloudsters-cloudsters-400.woff2
/enigma.enigma.woff2
/Screenshot *.jpg
/Kent Axell *.jpg
